+# Authored CRM craft illustration
+
+These are browser captures of the same labeled sample dataset rendered by Codex before and after applying the proposed rules. They are authored fixtures, not independently generated A/B builds or user research.
+
+- [Desktop comparison](compare-desktop.png): 1280x800 per side.
+- [Phone comparison](compare-phone.png): 390x844 per side.
+- [Before desktop](before-desktop.png), [after desktop](after-desktop.png), [before phone](before-phone.png), [after phone](after-phone.png).
+
+The baseline intentionally represents the owner-supplied defect classes. It is not the missing original CRM test artifact or proof of what the old pack always generates. The after uses the same four sample records, adds the corresponding stage-count chart, formats absent owners, and preserves table comparison through a contained scroller.
+
+No authenticated reference screenshots or independent aesthetic judgments were available for this illustration. Reference comparison, independent taste and the actual model A/B retest remain Not verified. Passing checks cannot establish an 8/10 visual score.
